        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144811,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>An element is what we call the opening tag, closing tag, and code in between.</p><p>Which one of these is an <strong>element</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;button&gt;Start Game&lt;/button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;button&gt;Start Game&lt;/button&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code an <code>h1</code> element that displays <code>My First Game</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;button&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/video&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My First Game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, followed by <code>My First Game</code>, and finally <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To create a webpage, you'll need an opening and closing HTML tag. Which one of these options will create an <strong>empty</strong> HTML webpage?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;button&gt; &lt;/button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt; &lt;/h1&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144814,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create a webpage by coding an <code>html</code> element.</p><p>Remember we can create an <code>html</code> element by coding <code>&lt;html&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/html&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;button&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h1&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;html&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/html&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144815,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>html</code> and <code>body</code> elements form the structure of a webpage. We place elements we want to display inside of the body.</p><p>Later, we'll learn about other elements that go inside of <code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code> to give game pages style and make them interactive.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;body&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/body&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which one of these codes defines the body of a webpage?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;body&gt; &lt;/body&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt; &lt;/h1&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;body&gt; &lt;/body&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the <code>body</code> element for this webpage.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code> followed by <code>body</code> and then <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;/</code>, <code>body</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 144818,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We must place contents, such as headings, inside the body tags. Display a heading on the webpage.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Level 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, followed by <code>Level 1</code>, and finally <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
